  "display_title": "The Tyrant's Whereabouts",
  "description": "Once upon a time, there was a handsome king who was greedy and cruel. When God reviewed the record of his life, God shook his head and asked the three women who suffered the most because of the king, \"What punishment would you like him to receive?\" The three women, glancing at one another, answered in unison, \"Please send all of us back to Earth.\" \n\nThe women took away his beauty, his swordsmanship, and his uncaring attitude, and the king is reincarnated as Ji-En the maid. The three women are reborn as men, and when they meet Ji-En, the tangled relationships from their past life reemerge…! \n\n\"What did I do in my past life to deserve this mess!\" \n\n(Source: Kakao Webtoon, translated)",
